{"id":"8bb723e2ae49f0a5","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-supernilpotent-term.md","title":"thm-supernilpotent-term","display":"thm-supernilpotent-term","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-supernilpotent]]","[[93-df-commutator]]"],"display":"thm-supernilpotent-term","label":"93-thm-supernilpotent-term","aliases":["93-thm-supernilpotent-term"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7c60f8381488af43\" href=\"?note=7c60f8381488af43\" title=\"93-df-supernilpotent\">93-df-supernilpotent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"18ca772ab524a46f\" href=\"?note=18ca772ab524a46f\" title=\"93-df-commutator\">93-df-commutator</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-supernilpotent-term"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-supernilpotent-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-supernilpotent-term</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-supernilpotent-term-thm-supernilpotent-term\">thm-supernilpotent-term <code>thm-supernilpotent-term</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> are its universal and diagonal congruences.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NablaFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{NablaFam}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SN}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SN}_{93}\\)</span> are the higher-commutator, repeated-congruence-family, and supernilpotence constructions of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7c60f8381488af43\" href=\"?note=7c60f8381488af43\" title=\"93-df-supernilpotent\">93-df-supernilpotent</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}supernilpotent\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SN}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\left(k\\ge1\\land\n\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}(\\operatorname{NablaFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;k);\\mathbf A,k)\n=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\right)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}supernilpotent\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SN}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\left(k\\ge1\\land\n\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}(\\operatorname{NablaFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;k);\\mathbf A,k)\n=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\right)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Supernilpotence is detected by vanishing of a higher commutator.  The implication fixes the signature witness instead of leaving <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> free on only one side of a type-forgetting equivalence.  The former binary-term condition was satisfied trivially by the projection term <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(x,y)=x\">\\(t(x,y)=x\\)</span> and therefore characterized nothing.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-supernilpotent-term-thm-supernilpotent-term","text":"thm-supernilpotent-term `thm-supernilpotent-term`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-supernilpotent","status":"resolved","id":"7c60f8381488af43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-supernilpotent]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-commutator]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-supernilpotent","status":"resolved","id":"7c60f8381488af43","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}$, $\\operatorname{NablaFam}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{SN}_{93}$ are the higher-commutator, repeated-congruence-family, and supernilpotence constructions of [[93-df-supernilpotent]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NablaFam}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SN}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}supernilpotent\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SN}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\left(k\\ge1\\land\n\\operatorname{HComm}_{93}(\\operatorname{NablaFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A;k);\\mathbf A,k)\n=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\right)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"t(x,y)=x","display":false}],"bytes":1287,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["7c60f8381488af43","18ca772ab524a46f"]}